This is **{{ m.version }}, the shipped model** (branch `main`): a {{ eda.n_classes }}-class intent classifier for logistics chat messages, fine-tuned from `{{ m.base_model }}`, with an optional abstention flag for messages unlike the training data. A robustness variant ({{ peer.version }}) is on branch `{{ peer.branch }}`.
